\[ s = \frac{400 \, \text{m}^2/\text{s}^2}{19.8 \, \text{m/s}^2} \]
\[ s = 20.418 \text{ m} \]

Thus, the maximum height reached by the particle is approximately \( 20.4 \, \text{m} \).

