7. Nanoparticles and liposomes: These can be designed to deliver drugs directly to the skin, improving penetration and reducing systemic exposure.

8. Prodrugs with skin-specific activation: Prodrugs can be designed to release the active drug only in the skin, minimizing systemic effects.

