   - \[ [ \text{Fe}^{3+}(i) = 1.0 \, \text{M} \]
   - \( \text{KCN} \rightarrow \text{CN}^-(aq] \). The initial concentration of \(\text{CN}^-(aq) = 0.25 \, \text{mol} / 1.0 \, \text{L} = 0.25 \, \text{M} \).
   - The initial concentration of \(\text{FeCN}_6^{4-} = 0 \, \text{M} \).

